{1}{[The woman in front of you is tall, strongly built, with a pair of scars running from the corner of each eye to the bottom of her jaw.  It makes her look as if she is crying.]  What do you want?  You got any reason to bother me, or you just enjoy rollin' the dice with old Scratch?}{What do you want?  You got any reason to bother me, or you just enjoy rollin' the dice with old Scratch?}{}{}{}{}
