{26}{Yeah!}{}{-4}{}{29}{}
{27}{Uh...I not like this.  I think I leave now...}{}{-4}{}{0}{lf1 1, fl 17}
{29}{Good.  'Cause what I'm tryin' to tell you is that you don't go into business with a man like Pollock unless you're going in all the way.  Plenty of blokes thought they wanted to be in Pollock's gang, then saw too much and got scared, tried to run.  [She smiles, wickedly.]  That's where I come in...}{Good.  'Cause what I'm tryin' to tell you is that you don't go into business with a man like Pollock unless you're going in all the way.  Plenty of blokes thought they wanted to be in Pollock's gang, then saw too much and got scared, tried to run.  [She smiles, wickedly.]  That's where I come in...}{}{}{}{}
{30}{And who might you be?}{}{5}{}{35}{}
