{35}{The names Tears...Miranda Tears.  I take care of things for Pollock, all sorts of things.  Like makin' sure he don't get any soft-hearts workin' for him.  Pollock doesn't like something or someone [She gives you a direct look.], then Miranda takes care of them.}{The names Tears...Miranda Tears.  I take care of things for Pollock, all sorts of things.  Like makin' sure he don't get any soft-hearts workin' for him.  Pollock doesn't like something or someone [She gives you a direct look.], then Miranda takes care of them.}{}{}{}{}
{36}{So.  When do you stop talking and give me a job?}{}{5}{ch 15}{43}{re +5}
