{50}{Yes, the job.  Well, it's not too hard, especially for someone that's got a brain in their skull.  We've been runnin' out of ale around here, and Pollock don't like it when he doesn't have his ale...}{Yes, the job.  Well, it's not too hard, especially for someone that's got a brain in their skull.  We've been runnin' out of ale around here, and Pollock don't like it when he doesn't have his ale...}{}{}{}{}
